    "section_70_30_QnJX77": {
      "name": "Section 70/30",
      "settings": {
        "background_type": "video",
        "body": "<p>Life can be complicated, but your wellness shouldn’t be. We create natural, science-backed solutions with real results & zero woo to solve the everyday problems all women deal with.<br/><br/>Our supplements target the root cause of not-so-glamorous struggles like bloating, stubborn weight, and sleepless nights—so you can feel your best, without the guesswork.<br/><br/>We keep it clean, simple, and chic because you should never have to compromise how you feel, even on your busiest days.</p>",
        "cta_label": "",
        "cta_open_in_new_tab": false,
