      "blocks": {
        "step_NFhdVC": {
          "settings": {
            "description": "<p>Back in 2020, we launched arrae with two products (Bloat and Calm) out of our tiny apartment in Toronto. We packed every order by hand, included a Polaroid selfie for every customer, and became obsessed with finding holistic solutions to everyday wellness problems that all women face.</p>",
            "eyebrow": "Where It All Started",
            "image_desktop": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_1171277801_3.jpg",
            "period": "2020",
            "step_indicator": "",
            "title": ""
          },
          "type": "step"
        },
        "step_QmyCtW": {
          "settings": {
            "description": "<p>Our shelf got a serious glow-up with four new launches: MB-1, Magnesium, Constipation, and Tribiotic. Plus, we hosted a series of community activations — from café pop-ups to a live, on-stage podcast.</p>",
            "eyebrow": "Elevating Your Routine",
            "image_desktop": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_1171277801_1.jpg",
            "period": "2024",
            "step_indicator": "",
            "title": ""
          },
          "type": "step"
        },
        "step_VKNeeH": {
          "settings": {
            "description": "<p>We landed in your local neighborhood — with 2,000+ new locations at Target nationwide, Ulta, Sprouts & more. We dropped our cult-favorite Tone Creatine Gummies, fan-favorite Clear Protein+, and ended the year by partnering with Pamela Anderson for the launch of MB-1 45+</p>",
            "eyebrow": "Expanding The Vision",
            "image_desktop": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_1171277801_2.jpg",
            "period": "2025",
            "step_indicator": "",
            "title": ""
          },
          "type": "step"
        },
        "step_wMnV97": {
          "settings": {
            "description": "<p>The makings of some of our earliest brand partnerships. We collaborated with The Skinny Confidential to release the limited-edition Le Depuff tincture (debloating drops), and even launched our own collab smoothie with Erewhon in Los Angeles.</p>",
